ection, “personal information” has the meaning provided by the California Consumer Privacy Act (the “`,T(`strong`,{children:`CCPA`}),`”), and does not include information that is (i)\xA0publicly available, (ii)\xA0deidentified or aggregated such that it is not capable of being associated with you, or (iii)\xA0that is excluded from the CCPA’s scope, such as personal information covered by certain sector-specific privacy laws, such as the HIPAA, the FCRA, GLBA or the Driver’s Privacy Protection Act of 1994. These CA Disclosures also do not apply to information relating to our employees, contractors, and other personnel.`]}),T(`p`,{id:`information-collection`,children:T(`strong`,{children:`HOW WE COLLECT AND USE INFORMATION`})}),T(`p`,{children:`We may collect personal information from and about you for a variety of purposes. For example, we use personal information to fulfill your requests, process your transactions and provide our Services to you; to communicate with you; for marketing and advertising purposes; to monitor, improve, and develop our products and Services; and to protect the security and integrity of our business, comply with legal requirements and obligations; for our business and operational purposes; and as otherwise permitted or required by law.`}),w(`p`,{children:[`To learn more about the types of personal information we collect and the purposes for which we collect this information, please refer to the`,` `,T(O,{to:`/legal/privacy_policy#information-collection`,children:T(`strong`,{children:`How We Collect Your Information`})}),` `,`of the `,T(O,{to:`/legal/privacy_policy`,children:`Privacy Policy`}),`.`]}),T(`p`,{children:`In the last 12 months, we may have collected the following categories of personal information:`}),w(`ul`,{children:[w(`li`,{children:[T(`strong`,{children:`Identifiers`}),`, such as your first and last name, physical address, phone number, email address or other similar identifiers.`]}),w(`li`,{children:[T(`strong`,{children:`C