d parties, subject to your Right to Opt-Out of those sales (see`,` `,T(`strong`,{children:`Your Rights and Choices`}),`below). The categories of third parties to whom we sell or disclose your personal information for a business purpose include: (i)\xA0other brands and affiliates in our family of companies; (ii)\xA0our service providers and advisors; (iii)\xA0marketing and strategic partners; (iv)\xA0promotional partners; (v)\xA0ad networks and advertising partners; (vi)\xA0analytics providers; (vii)\xA0social networks.\xA0`]}),T(`p`,{children:`In the previous 12\xA0months, we may have disclosed the following categories of personal information to third parties for a business purpose:`}),T(`ul`,{children:w(`li`,{children:[`All of the categories of personal information we collect, explained in the`,` `,T(O,{to:`#information-collection`,children:T(`strong`,{children:`How We Collect and Use Information`})}),` `,`section above.`]})}),T(`p`,{children:`Unless you have exercised your Right to Opt-Out of personal information sales, we may sell or share personal information to third parties for monetary or other valuable consideration. The third parties to whom we sell or share personal information may use such information for their own purposes in accordance with their own privacy statements, which may include reselling this information to additional third parties.`}),T(`p`,{children:`In the previous 12 months, we may have sold or shared the following categories of personal information to third parties:`}),w(`ul`,{children:[T(`li`,{children:`Identifiers`}),T(`li`,{children:`Commercial Information`}),T(`li`,{children:`Internet / Network Information`})]}),w(`p`,{children:[`As is common practice among companies that operate online, we have permitted third party advertising networks, social media companies and other third party businesses collect and disclose your personal information (including Internet / Network Information, Commercial Information, and Inferences) directly from