s in your personal data, taking into account the nature of the personal data and the purposes of the processing of your personal data.`]}),w(`li`,{children:[T(`strong`,{children:`The Right to Request Deletion`}),` of personal information we have collected from you, subject to certain exceptions.`]}),w(`li`,{children:[T(`strong`,{children:`The Right to Opt-Out of Personal Information Sales or Sharing`}),`, specifically you have the right to direct us not to “sell” your personal information to third parties for monetary or other valuable consideration, or “share” your personal information to third parties for cross-context behavioral advertising purposes. If you are under the age of 16, you have the right to opt in, or to have a parent or guardian opt in on your behalf, to such sales or sharing.`]})]}),T(`p`,{children:`You also have the right to be free of discrimination for exercising these rights. However, please note that if the exercise of these rights limits our ability to process personal information (such as in the case of a deletion request), we may no longer be able to provide you our products and services or engage with you in the same manner.`}),T(`p`,{id:`exercise-rights`,children:T(`strong`,{children:`HOW TO EXERCISE YOUR CALIFORNIA PRIVACY RIGHTS`})}),T(`p`,{children:`You may submit a request to exercise your California Consumer Rights through one of the mechanisms described below. We will need to verify your identity before processing your request, which may require us to request additional personal information from you or require you to log into your account, if you have one. In certain circumstances, we may decline or limit your request, particularly where we are unable to verify your identity or locate your information in our systems, or as permitted by law.`}),T(`p`,{children:`To exercise your Right to Know, Right to Correct, and/or Right to Deletion, please submit a request by:`}),w(`ul`,{children:[w(`li`,{children:[`Emailing`,` `,T(`a`,{href:`mail